    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Some homes have character. Gillies Hut has a story.\n\nSitting just over the bridge in the heart of Foxford, with the River Moy on its doorstep, this wonderfully individual home is filled with charm, history and personality.\n\nOnce associated with the local gillies who gathered here to talk fishing, shooting and life on the Moy, Gillies Hut has been transformed into a warm and stylish home while retaining so much of its original character.\n\nStep inside to exposed stone walls, timber floors, a cosy solid-fuel stove and that fabulous open staircase. Upstairs are two bedrooms, a family bathroom and a lovely open landing area, with glimpses towards the River Moy.\n\nAnd then there's the outside space… \n\nA beautifully created private walled courtyard, where stone walls, herbs, gravel and a sheltered seating area turn a compact space into a little haven. Sit outside on a summer's day and you're within earshot of the River Moy.\n\nAnd the location? Right in Foxford, moments from the river, Foxford Woollen Mills and everything this wonderful town has to offer.\n\nTake the full tour and discover Gillies Hut for yourself. A little piece of Foxford history, ready for its next chapter.\n\nFEATURES:\nCharming two-bedroom home full of character\nPrime location in the heart of Foxford\nRiver Moy just moments from the doorstep\nBeautiful exposed stone feature walls\nOpen timber staircase\nSolid fuel stove and Oil central heating\nBright open-plan living and dining space\nModern fitted kitchen\nPrivate, sheltered walled courtyard\nTurnkey\n\nRequest your digital brochure"
      },
